y 2024, clase 2.2.5 (visualizador.ideam.gov.co), consultado el 2026-11-17. Municipios y cabeceras: DANE, MGN 2025. Importaciones de flores de Estados Unidos\nen 2024: USDA, en farmdoc daily (Universidad de Illinois, febrero de 2025). Viento: Open-Meteo, reanálisis ERA5 (Copernicus), 2024. Cómo se hizo: todo en RustGIS web\n(web.rustgis.app), con cuatro scripts. Scripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":5.2,"color":[133,122,108,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":80,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":292.3,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"© José Gregorio Rincón · CC BY 4.0 · #30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 19: Senses: Smell · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":6.5,"color":[78,70,60,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":81},{"name":"Day 19","width":210.0,"height":297.0,"elements":[{"id":2,"name":"Rectangle","x":0.0,"y":0.0,"w":210.0,"h":297.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[241,234,223,255],"outline":[241,234,223,0],"width":0.0}}},{"id":1,"name":"Map Frame","x":12.0,"y":37.0,"w":186.0,"h":176.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Sabana de Bogotá","center":{"x":-74.3,"y":4.8},"scale":150000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":null}}},{"id":3,"name":"Rectangle","x":12.0,"y":37.0,"w":50.0,"h":41.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[241,234,223,242],"outline":[241,234,223,0],"width":0.0}}},{"id":4,"name":"Map Frame","x":14.0,"y":39.0,"w":25.0,"h":37.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Sabana de Bogotá","center":{"x":-74.075,"y":4.905},"scale":3400000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":1,"extent_color":[194,24,91,255],"extent_width":0.8}}},{"id":5,"name":"Map Frame","x":40.0,"y":40.0,"w":21.0,"h":30.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"MapFrame":{"map":"Colombia","center":{"x":-73.2,"y":4.1},"scale":66000000.0,"shape":"Rectangle","grid":null,"extent_of":4,"extent_color":[194,24,91,255],"extent_width":0.8}}},{"id":6,"name":"Rectangle","x":11.6,"y":36.6,"w":186.8,"h":0.8,